#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:1
#: 0bdb6fa6c7d344d6b00c3a297521cb52
msgid "Operations and contribution"
msgstr "Operacion y contribucion"

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:3
#: 95785d5a947a4b6e8674f5f626ea908b
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:5
#: 322a0b87021446578cff562b3bb71bcc
msgid ""
"Keep secrets outside documentation and source control. Use `.env.example` as"
" the public contract and store real values only in the designated local "
"settings surface."
msgstr ""
"Mantenga los secretos fuera de la documentacion y del control de codigo. Use"
" `.env.example` como contrato publico y guarde los valores reales solo en la"
" superficie local designada."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:7
#: 9d1c66f1941942098c6812f50eb95143
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Pruebas"

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:9
#: dce95b328c2e4f2cab33e3326e20ddd8
msgid ""
"Run the repository checks listed in the quickstart. A passing narrow test "
"does not prove unrelated interfaces or scientific claims."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute las comprobaciones del repositorio indicadas en el inicio rapido. "
"Una prueba acotada superada no demuestra interfaces no relacionadas ni "
"afirmaciones cientificas."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:11
#: 762b42ccb485489c9d6dcdff99f63237
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solucion de problemas"

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:13
#: 8e421dd2d8aa4665807748fa2c0cbd5a
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirme el repositorio y la rama."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:14
#: bf852cc56f3c4f71946fc4919206fae7
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduzca con la entrada compatible mas pequena."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:15
#: b89701d7cfa44531b615e6ed159714c0
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Registre el comando y el error exactos."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:16
#: e39a111be85a47ceb7333e57b963077d
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Compruebe el runtime documentado y el archivo de bloqueo."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:17
#: 9efb0f69b26f4b1a94141c5044b24bbf
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Abra una incidencia con evidencia sin secretos."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:19
#: 69ee1332ab8940db8f9c86699830d7c1
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Seguridad y privacidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:21
#: 7153af97dfff4b2299a3fc18370bf80e
msgid ""
"V.O.T. Guardian must not be used for attack, surveillance, autonomous "
"accusation, or unsupervised enforcement."
msgstr ""
"V.O.T. Guardian no debe usarse para ataques, vigilancia, acusaciones "
"autonomas ni aplicacion no supervisada."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:23
#: 79c40a82c5514c90981e4aba50b7f979
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuir"

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:25
#: 9b43c440e69e4acd8cd8d9b9c2929e18
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lea `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` y la licencia del "
"repositorio cuando existan. Mantenga los cambios acotados e incluya las "
"comprobaciones que justifican su aceptacion."

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:27
#: caace71be4cd42a4ae82df8689918050
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versiones publicadas"

#: ../../docs/tools/vot-guardian/operations.md:29
#: 0f1c7590c3e3439ebcf883162aa18ec1
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `pre-alpha` with status `public-"
"preview`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentacion publica actual describe `pre-alpha` con el estado `public-"
"preview`. Consulte el historial del repositorio y las notas de version para "
"conocer los cambios."
